Specification Entity with Entity 


Datatype SimpleText 
Description Characters, Numbers, and Some Punctuation 
Details   a-z, A-Z, 0-9, [,.-_]
Examples: ValidValues
| Value                            | isValid | Notes |
| abcZAB123,.-                     | Yes     |       |
| '                                | No      |       |
| adsfa0324ofdsalkuwernvcx,zkadf., | Yes     |       |

Datatype State 
Description Two character state abbreviation 
Examples: EnumerationValues
| Value | Notes          |
| TX    | Texas          |
| NC    | North Carolina |

Datatype ZipCode
Description US Zip Code 
Details  five and nine digits 
Examples: ValidValues
| Value      | isValid | Notes |
| 12345      | yes     |       |
| 1234       | no      |       |
| 12345-6789 | yes     |       |
| 123446790  | no      |       |

Entity Address 
| Name   | Type       | Default | Notes |
| Street | SimpleText |         |       |
| City   | SimpleText |         |       |
| State  | State      |         |       |
| ZIP    | String     |         |       |

Define ABillingAddress = 
| Street       | City      | State | ZIP   |
| 1 Apple Lane | Somewhere | NC    | 27705 |

Define AShippingAddress = 
| Street       | City      | State | ZIP   |
| 2 Apple Lane | Somewhere | NC    | 27706 |

Entity TwoAddresses 
| Name            | Type    | Default | Notes |
| ShippingAddress | Address |         |       |
| BillingAddress  | Address |         |       |

Scenario   Entity with Addresses
Given entity: TwoAddresses 
| ShippingAddress   | BillingAddress   |
| =AShippingAddress | =ABillingAddress |
Then shipping address is : Address 
=AShippingAddress 
And billing address is: Address 
=ABillingAddress 
